---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Cal-Kie — Your week, your workout">
<div class="app-shell">
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Cal-Kie home"><span class="brand-mark">CK</span><span>cal<span class="brand-accent">-kie</span></span></a><div class="topbar-right"><span class="live-label"><i></i> YOUR PERSONAL TRAINING SPACE</span><button class="button button-menu" id="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-controls="app-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open navigation menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header>
<button class="menu-backdrop" id="menu-backdrop" type="button" aria-label="Close navigation menu" hidden></button>
<aside class="app-menu" id="app-menu" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Main navigation" hidden><div class="app-menu-head"><span>YOUR SPACE</span><button class="menu-close" id="menu-close" type="button" aria-label="Close menu">×</button></div><a class="app-menu-link active" href="/"><span>⌂</span><span><strong>Home</strong><small>Your training space</small></span></a><a class="app-menu-link app-menu-primary" href="/workout-builder"><span>✦</span><span><strong>Generate Workout</strong><small>Build a week around your goals</small></span><span class="menu-arrow">→</span></a></aside>
<main class="page">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">MOVE WITH A PLAN</p><h1>Your week.<br/><em>Your kind of strong.</em></h1><p class="hero-text">Build a workout week around your time, your goals and the way you like to train. Then make every day yours.</p><a class="button button-primary home-builder-link" href="/workout-builder"><span>✦</span> Generate my workout</a></div><div class="hero-stats" aria-label="Workout plan summary"><div><strong>7</strong><span>days planned</span></div><div><strong>5</strong><span>training days</span></div><div><strong>60</strong><span>minutes / session</span></div></div></section>
<section class="routine-panel" id="two-week-routine"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR TWO-WEEK TRAINING PLAN</p><h2>Push · Legs · Pull · Full Body</h2><p class="routine-intro">Your structured 14-day split with form cues and exercise GIFs.</p></div><div class="routine-selectors"><label>Week<select id="routine-week"><option value="1">Week 1</option><option value="2">Week 2</option></select></label><label>Day<select id="routine-day"><option value="0">Monday</option><option value="1">Tuesday</option><option value="2">Wednesday</option><option value="3">Thursday</option><option value="4">Friday</option><option value="5">Saturday</option><option value="6">Sunday</option></select></label></div></div><div id="routine-content" class="routine-content"></div><p class="routine-footnote">Week 1: practise technique and establish weights. Week 2: improve reps or load only with good form. Repeat for 4–6 weeks and track progress; don't force weekly increases. Core work balances flexion, obliques and deep stability.</p></section>
<footer class="app-footer"><span>cal-kie · made to move with you</span><span>Exercise demonstrations are fetched on demand from ExerciseDB by AscendAPI. Free V1 use is non-commercial; attribution is shown. GIFs are not saved by Cal-Kie.</span></footer>
</main></div>
<script>import "../scripts/two-week-routine";</script><script>import "../scripts/navigation";</script>
<style>
.routine-panel{margin:34px 0;background:#18231c;border:1px solid #405343;border-radius:22px;padding:26px}.routine-intro,.routine-note{color:#a9b9aa;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.routine-selectors{display:flex;gap:10px}.routine-selectors label{display:grid;gap:5px;font-size:10px}.routine-selectors select{background:#111a14;color:#edf4ed;border:1px solid #405143;border-radius:8px;padding:9px}.routine-day-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #304035;padding-bottom:14px}.routine-day-heading h3{font:700 20px Manrope;margin:0}.routine-group{margin:20px 0}.routine-group h3{font:700 14px Manrope;color:#c6f36b}.routine-exercises{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.routine-exercise{background:#111a14;border:1px solid #304035;border-radius:13px;padding:14px}.routine-exercise-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.routine-exercise h4{font:700 13px Manrope;margin:0}.routine-exercise-head p{font-size:10px;color:#c6f36b}.routine-gif-button,.gif-choice{background:#202d24;border:1px solid #596d4a;color:#c6f36b;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;font-size:10px}.routine-exercise ol{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#b8c6b8;padding-left:18px}.routine-gif img,.gif-choice img{width:min(100%,240px);max-height:190px;object-fit:contain;background:white;border-radius:8px}.routine-gif small{display:block;color:#9aab9d;font-size:9px;margin-top:6px}.routine-gif small button{background:none;border:0;color:#c6f36b}.gif-choice{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;margin:4px}.routine-special{background:#202d24;padding:18px;border-radius:12px}.routine-special p{font-size:12px;color:#a9b9aa}.routine-footnote{font-size:10px;color:#9aab9d;line-height:1.7}.home-builder-link{display:inline-flex;margin-top:22px;align-items:center;gap:8px}@media(max-width:700px){.routine-exercises{grid-template-columns:1fr}.routine-day-heading{flex-direction:column}.routine-panel{padding:18px}.routine-selectors{width:100%}.routine-selectors label{flex:1}.routine-selectors select{width:100%}}
</style>
</Layout>